  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "37f1fb9ccd3f94c1",
      "translationZh": "Anyscale 团队 Richard Liaw 的客座博文",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c718d08d8d316ac8",
      "translationZh": "借助前沿的研究实现和触手可及的数千个训练好的模型，Hugging Face transformers 库已成为当今自然语言处理的成功与发展的关键。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4802e2146ef1fd0c",
      "translationZh": "要让任何机器学习模型取得良好性能，用户通常需要实现某种形式的参数调优。然而，几乎所有人（1、2）最终要么干脆放弃超参数调优，要么选择在一个很小的搜索空间里做简单的网格搜索。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e6cda0e22e24064",
      "translationZh": "然而，简单的实验就能展示先进调优技术的收益。下面是最近在 RTE 数据集上用 Hugging Face transformers 的 BERT 模型做的一项实验。与标准超参数优化技术相比，PBT 这类遗传优化技术可以带来巨大的性能提升。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d704d8af25bed5a5",
      "translationZh": "算法",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a81a31c02a9850d",
      "translationZh": "验证集最佳准确率",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97ff4712a955d2db",
      "translationZh": "测试集最佳准确率",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "821abca842d79988",
