      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aea83998e6dbabb9",
      "translationZh": "贝叶斯优化 + 早停",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "528480e09d30312c",
      "translationZh": "104 分钟",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a82b09b3609739dd",
      "translationZh": "基于种群的训练（Population-based Training）",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b48f11c7390ca52",
      "translationZh": "48 分钟",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cff5a37e4c84d252",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在使用 Transformers，你会希望有一种方式能轻松获得强大的超参数调优方案，同时又不放弃 Transformers 框架的可定制性。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e331bd70de65b086",
      "translationZh": "在 Transformers 3.1 版本中，Hugging Face Transformers 与 Ray Tune 联手提供了一个简单而强大的集成。Ray Tune 是一个流行的 Python 超参数调优库，开箱即用地提供许多最先进的算法，并与 Weights and Biases、tensorboard 等一流工具集成。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae122d5ff2a2868f",
      "translationZh": "为了演示这套新的 Hugging Face + Ray Tune 集成，我们利用 Hugging Face Datasets 库在 MRPC 数据集上微调 BERT。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa1b88db2f6b99d8",
      "translationZh": "要运行本示例，请先执行：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74b9b2f37993661c",
      "translationZh": "执行安装：pip install \"ray[tune]\" transformers datasets scipy sklearn torch",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6709bfa6be3b56d6",
      "translationZh": "只需添加几行代码，即可接入 Ray 的某个标准调优算法。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3fcd38d3ccd831b1",
      "translationZh": "默认情况下，每个试验（trial）将使用 1 个 CPU，如果有 GPU 还会使用 1 个 GPU。通过传入 resources_per_trial 参数，你可以利用多个 GPU 进行并行超参数搜索。",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ff25d6945439c70",
      "translationZh": "你还可以轻松换用不同的参数调优算法，例如 HyperBand、贝叶斯优化、基于种群的训练：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef19cedc0f41da71",
      "translationZh": "要运行本示例，先执行：pip install hyperopt",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3276a04ae6a56ae2",
      "translationZh": "它还开箱即用地支持 Weights and Biases！",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b4686b869471308f",
      "translationZh": "立即试用：",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e31a30756e37f0a3",
      "translationZh": "执行安装：pip install -U ray",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c19383569be310bf",
      "translationZh": "执行安装：pip install -U transformers datasets",
      "provider": "zcode-local",
      "model": "GLM-5.3-Flash"
    },
    {
